A continuation row's open run, and an escaped closing pipe

```
| a `b |
+ c` |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a <code>b c</code></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a b \|
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a b |</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a \| b | c |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a | b</td><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a `b |
+ c | d` |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a <code>b c | d</code></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| x | a `b |
+ y | c` |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>x y</td><td>a <code>b c</code></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
